{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Cursed!: each lane's curse needs the reply to its own proof request",
  "contract": [
    "Issue #10788. Narcolepsy 901841 (major, forced first) and Weakness 901802 (minor, forced 5 s later)",
    "send their reminders about 10 s after the first force. An unrelated reply releases neither; the minor",
    "reply, sent at once, still waits the full 5 s after its reminder and releases only Weakness; the",
    "major lane stays held until its own reply. Same-update sends are covered by the unit tests."
